What the toolchain compiles with KSP processors, toolchain plugins, compiler settings or compiler
plugins krusty-toolchain does not pass is refused where it is set, for every module the task
needs, before anything is compiled.
--- task
:app:compileJvm
--- project.yaml
modules:
  - app
  - lib
--- app/module.yaml
product: jvm/app
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
dependencies:
  - ../lib
plugins:
  my-plugin: enabled
settings:
  kotlin:
    languageVersion: "2.3"
    freeCompilerArgs:
      - -Xcontext-parameters
    explicitApi: strict
    allOpen: enabled
  springBoot:
    enabled: true
    applyBom: false
--- app/src/main.kt
fun main() = Unit
--- lib/module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
settings:
  kotlin:
    allWarningsAsErrors: true
    optIns:
      - kotlin.ExperimentalStdlibApi
    ksp:
      processors:
        - org.example:processor:1.0
--- lib/src/Lib.kt
class Lib
--- krusty-refusal
error	lib/module.yaml:11:9: ERROR: module `lib` runs KSP processors (`settings.kotlin.ksp.processors`), and krusty-toolchain does not run KSP
error	lib/module.yaml:8:7: ERROR: module `lib` sets `settings.kotlin.optIns`, and krusty-toolchain does not implement compiling with it
error	lib/module.yaml:6:26: ERROR: module `lib` sets `settings.kotlin.allWarningsAsErrors`, and krusty-toolchain does not implement compiling with it
error	app/module.yaml:7:3: ERROR: module `app` enables toolchain plugin `my-plugin`, which the project does not list in its `plugins`
error	app/module.yaml:10:22: ERROR: module `app` sets `settings.kotlin.languageVersion`, and krusty-toolchain does not implement compiling with it
error	app/module.yaml:12:7: ERROR: module `app` sets `settings.kotlin.freeCompilerArgs`, and krusty-toolchain does not implement compiling with it
error	app/module.yaml:13:18: ERROR: module `app` sets `settings.kotlin.explicitApi`, and krusty-toolchain does not implement compiling with it
error	app/module.yaml:14:14: ERROR: module `app` sets `settings.kotlin.allOpen.enabled`, and krusty-toolchain does not implement compiling with it
error	app/module.yaml:16:14: ERROR: module `app` sets `settings.springBoot.enabled`, which the toolchain compiles with compiler plugins krusty-toolchain does not implement
